msgstr ""
"Plagáty s dlhými názvami sa posúvajú, keď na ne ukážete. Otvorte jeden a "
"uvidíte podrobnosti a obsadenie; kliknutím na herca uvidíte jeho ďalšie "
"tituly vo vašich playlistoch."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1247
msgid "Favorites and recordings"
msgstr "Obľúbené a nahrávky"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1248
msgid ""
"The heart keeps channels, movies and series here; recordings of live TV are "
"listed in Recordings."
msgstr ""
"Srdiečko sem ukladá kanály, filmy a seriály; nahrávky živého vysielania "
"nájdete v Nahrávkach."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1252
msgid ""
"Add M3U or Xtream lists. Each list can have backup servers (other DNS of the "
"provider): the dots show if each one is online, slow or down, and AshyTV "
"switches automatically."
msgstr ""
"Pridajte zoznamy M3U alebo Xtream. Každý zoznam môže mať záložné servery "
"(iné DNS poskytovateľa): bodky ukazujú, či je každý online, pomalý alebo "
"nedostupný, a AshyTV prepína automaticky."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1258
msgid ""
"Themes and colors, hidden channels and groups, secure DNS, parental PIN and "
"more."
msgstr ""
"Motívy a farby, skryté kanály a skupiny, zabezpečené DNS, rodičovský PIN a "
"ďalšie."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1261
msgid "See it again"
msgstr "Zobraziť znova"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1262
msgid ""
"Reopen this tour from the main menu (Guided tour) or from Settings → About."
msgstr ""
"Túto prehliadku znova otvoríte z hlavnej ponuky (Sprievodca aplikáciou) "
"alebo z Nastavenia → O aplikácii."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1312
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“{name}”: the main server is not answering. Using the backup server."
msgstr "„{name}“: hlavný server neodpovedá. Používa sa záložný server."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1315
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“{name}”: the main server is back."
msgstr "„{name}“: hlavný server je späť."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1321
msgid "AshyTV servers"
msgstr "Servery AshyTV"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1343
msgid "Switching to the main server…"
msgstr "Prepína sa na hlavný server…"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1344
msgid "Switching to the backup server…"
msgstr "Prepína sa na záložný server…"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1414
msgid "Programme"
msgstr "Relácia"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1418
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You will be reminded of “{title}” at {time}"
msgstr "Pripomenieme vám „{title}“ o {time}"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1419
msgid "Reminder cancelled"
msgstr "Pripomienka zrušená"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1431
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“{title}” starts soon on {channel}"
msgstr "„{title}“ čoskoro začína na kanáli {channel}"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1433
msgid "AshyTV reminder"
msgstr "Pripomienka AshyTV"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1452
msgid "This channel is no longer in your playlists."
msgstr "Tento kanál už nie je vo vašich playlistoch."

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1492
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Group “{name}” hidden"
msgstr "Skupina „{name}“ skrytá"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1493
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Category “{name}” hidden"
msgstr "Kategória „{name}“ je skrytá"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1507
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Channel “{name}” hidden"
msgstr "Kanál „{name}“ je skrytý"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1513
msgid "To show it again: Settings → Hidden channels and groups"
msgstr "Znova zobraziť: Nastavenia → Skryté kanály a skupiny"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1515
msgid "See hidden"
msgstr "Zobraziť skryté"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1520
msgid "Undo"
msgstr "Vrátiť späť"

#: src/ashytv/window.py:1802
msgid "Could not save now: a playlist is being updated. Try again."
msgstr "Teraz sa nedá uložiť: aktualizuje sa zoznam. Skúste to znova."

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:3
#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:4
msgid "AshyTV"
msgstr "AshyTV"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:4
msgid "IPTV Player"
msgstr "IPTV prehrávač"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:5
msgid "Watch your own IPTV playlists (M3U and Xtream Codes)"
msgstr "Sledujte vlastné IPTV playlisty (M3U a Xtream Codes)"

#. Translators: search keywords, separated by semicolons; keep the trailing semicolon.
#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.desktop.in:7
msgid "iptv;tv;m3u;xtream;epg;player;live;channels;movies;series;"
msgstr "iptv;tv;m3u;xtream;epg;player;live;channels;movies;series;prehrávač;televízia;naživo;kanály;filmy;seriály;"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:5
msgid "Modern IPTV player for your own playlists"
msgstr "Moderný IPTV prehrávač pre vaše vlastné playlisty"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:9
msgid "Community Big"
msgstr "Community Big"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:12
msgid ""
"AshyTV is a GTK4/libadwaita IPTV player. Import your own M3U playlist or "
"Xtream Codes account and browse live channels, an electronic program guide, "
"movies and series. AshyTV is only a player: it does not host or sell any "
"content."
msgstr ""
"AshyTV je IPTV prehrávač postavený na GTK4/libadwaita. Importujte vlastný "
"zoznam M3U alebo účet Xtream Codes a prechádzajte živé kanály, programového "
"sprievodcu, filmy a seriály. AshyTV je len prehrávač: nehosťuje ani "
"nepredáva žiadny obsah."

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Optional Free TV: links to free-to-air channels and to public domain or "
"openly licensed films"
msgstr ""
"Voliteľná TV zadarmo: odkazy na voľne vysielané kanály a na voľné diela či "
"filmy s otvorenou licenciou"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Live channels with categories, favorites and now-playing info"
msgstr ""
"Živé kanály s kategóriami, obľúbenými a informáciami o aktuálnej relácii"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Program guide (XMLTV) in a time grid"
msgstr "Programový sprievodca (XMLTV) v časovej mriežke"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid "Movies and series catalog with resume and next episode"
msgstr "Katalóg filmov a seriálov s pokračovaním a ďalšou epizódou"

#: data/org.communitybig.ashytv.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid ""
"libmpv playback with hardware decoding, picture-in-picture and recording"
msgstr ""
"Prehrávanie cez libmpv s hardvérovým dekódovaním, obrazom v obraze a "
"nahrávaním"

